--[[
  AZERTOX REDEEMER — SURGICAL REVAMP CHANGELOG

  * Rebuilt the visible surface around Main, Riddle, Triggers and Log while keeping
    the existing redeem engine, local RIDDLER_DB and assistant module.
  * Added an optional Gemini Riddle API with local fallback, a manual
    Scan code path, compact submit controls and a configurable spam-submit toggle.
  * Removed the old two-word probe path; collection now submits only at the
    configured Submit after count and keeps invalid retries in the same buffer.
  * Fixed the Sniper grid, log/history layout, visible utility bar placement and
    the `settings` API shadowing in the optimizer.
  * Made submitFast single-shot: Activated, MouseButton1Click and FocusLost are
    fallback routes, never three submissions for one code.
  * Added cached code-box ancestry visibility state, notifier restoration and a
    complete unload path for connections, loops, hooks and GUI state.
  * Wired the trigger cache into the matcher, removed the duplicate blink state,
    and added per-prompt autobuy debounce.
  * Added the shared manual Scan pipeline, final-submit flag health sampling,
    stats bar, independent history, session export, CMDR tests and safe profiles.
  * Added palette-backed winter recoloring, anti-AFK, reconnect, panic/cancel keys,
    configurable HUD name and bounded layout persistence.
  * Merged the readable Admin Abuse controls from the backup: F anchor, H instant-buy,
    G autobuy, prompt cleanup, restored prompt properties and a scroll-safe admin page.
  * Restored the original 2-word probe and invalid-retype state machine, including
    queued final submits and repeated submission when Spam submit is enabled.
  * Riddle lookup now strips announcement envelopes and apostrophes before exact lookup.
  * Gemini keys are entered by the owner and persisted only in the local config
    files; no key is embedded in this script.

  BUG TABLE (canonical file / line)

  | Bug | Cause | Corrective anchor |
  | premature submit | two-word probe ignored Submit after | current capture/retry state machine |
  | Sniper overlap | cancel and tile coordinates shared a row | `azertoxbest_original_backup.txt:1062`, `:1065` |
  | unload inert | button had no lifecycle owner | `azertoxbest_original_backup.txt:4394` |
  | utility bar clipped | negative Y under ClipsDescendants | `azertoxbest_original_backup.txt:1682` |
  | double submit | submit routes fired together | `azertoxbest_original_backup.txt:3701`, `:3733` |
  | duplicate blink | two independent declarations | `azertoxbest_original_backup.txt:3396` |
  | `settings` shadow | optimizer resolved local table | `azertoxbest_original_backup.txt:53` |
  | riddle worker race | removed with the riddle surface | `azertoxbest_original_backup.txt:4-7` |
  | UI visibility churn | every resolve rewrote every ancestor | `azertoxbest_original_backup.txt:3603` |
  | unused trigger cache | matcher rebuilt its own list | `azertoxbest_original_backup.txt:4085` |
  | notifier not restored | cleanup list was declared too late | `azertoxbest_original_backup.txt:3810` |
  | autobuy spam | prompt fired every tick | `azertoxbest_original_backup.txt:1121` |
  ]]

